WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.647 --> 00:00:02.795
BECAUSE THERE’S NO UNDERLYING

00:00:02.797 --> 00:00:04.023
PROBLEMS THAT AMERICAN CITIZENS

00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:05.518
MAY BE REACTING AGAINST.

00:00:05.519 --> 00:00:06.931
WHAT IS GOING ON HERE, EXACTLY.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:10.791
HERE TO TELL US, A MAN WHOSE

00:00:10.825 --> 00:00:12.534
NAME HAS BECOME A SYNONYM FOR

00:00:12.535 --> 00:00:14.421
RECKLESSNESS, BUT HE WAS LEARNED

00:00:14.456 --> 00:00:15.751
FROM HIS EXPERIENCES AND HAS

00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:17.241
SOME INTERESTING THINGS TO SAY

00:00:17.276 --> 00:00:18.588
ABOUT THE MOMENT WE ARE IN RIGHT

00:00:18.590 --> 00:00:18.877
NOW.

00:00:18.911 --> 00:00:19.872
JORDAN BELFORD, THE ORIGINAL

00:00:19.874 --> 00:00:21.893
BOTH OF WALL STREET.

00:00:21.927 --> 00:00:25.937
WE ARE HAPPY TO HAVE HIM ON

00:00:25.971 --> 00:00:26.425
TONIGHT.

00:00:26.426 --> 00:00:28.023
YOU HAVE PARTICIPATED IN THIS

00:00:28.024 --> 00:00:28.855
FROM EVERY POSSIBLE ANGLE,

00:00:28.889 --> 00:00:29.958
YOU’VE WATCHED IT FOR DECADES,

00:00:29.992 --> 00:00:32.674
WHAT DO YOU THINK IS GOING ON

00:00:32.675 --> 00:00:33.050
HERE?

00:00:33.052 --> 00:00:34.775
&gt;&gt; WELCOME I THINK YOU HAD IT

00:00:34.777 --> 00:00:36.035
RIGHT ON THE HEAD.

00:00:36.068 --> 00:00:37.237
AND THAT WAS MY THESIS FOR

00:00:37.271 --> 00:00:37.670
TONIGHT.

00:00:37.672 --> 00:00:39.723
THIS WAS REALLY A CONVERGENCE OF

00:00:39.724 --> 00:00:40.809
A FEW DIFFERENT THINGS.

00:00:40.843 --> 00:00:42.998
NUMBER ONE, FINALLY THE LITTLE

00:00:42.999 --> 00:00:45.408
GUY HAS THE ABILITY TO FIGHT

00:00:45.409 --> 00:00:47.222
BACK THROUGH A CONVERGENCE OF

00:00:47.257 --> 00:00:48.140
TECHNOLOGY, THE PLATFORMS FOR

00:00:48.141 --> 00:00:49.791
TRADING, THE ABILITY TO

00:00:49.793 --> 00:00:50.893
COMMUNICATE AS A GROUP.

00:00:50.894 --> 00:00:52.463
SO IN THE PAST, YOU COULD’VE

00:00:52.464 --> 00:00:54.041
NEVER DONE THIS BEFORE.

00:00:54.042 --> 00:00:55.610
SO THERE ARE TWO TYPES IN THIS

00:00:55.611 --> 00:00:56.262
WORLD.

00:00:56.263 --> 00:00:57.809
THERE IS LEGITIMATE ONCE THAT’S

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:00.319
A NATURAL PART OF THE MARKET AND

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:02.638
ANOTHER PART THAT ARE THE HEDGE

00:01:02.639 --> 00:01:04.945
FUNDS THAT GANG UP AND LITERALLY

00:01:04.947 --> 00:01:06.878
WILL SHORT A STOCK ALMOST DOWN

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:08.371
TO ZERO.

00:01:08.372 --> 00:01:11.420
THEY TRIED TO SPREAD NEGATIVE

00:01:11.421 --> 00:01:13.756
NEWS, INVESTIGATIONS, AND THAT’S

00:01:13.758 --> 00:01:16.823
WHAT IS SEEN WITH GAME STOP.

00:01:16.824 --> 00:01:19.080
THIS, I THINK, CONNECTS TO A FAR

00:01:19.081 --> 00:01:20.753
BIGGER THING THAN JUST TRYING TO

00:01:20.787 --> 00:01:22.151
MAKE A FEW BUCKS ON A TRADE.

00:01:22.152 --> 00:01:24.352
THIS IS ABOUT THE END OF THE

00:01:24.353 --> 00:01:26.360
MOVIE OF THE BIG SHORT -- ALL

00:01:26.395 --> 00:01:28.475
THE BAD GUYS WENT TO JAIL.

00:01:28.477 --> 00:01:29.066
JUST KIDDING.

00:01:29.067 --> 00:01:30.895
NOBODY WENT TO JAIL.

00:01:30.930 --> 00:01:32.060
I THINK EVERYBODY KNOWS THERE’S

00:01:32.062 --> 00:01:35.320
SOMETHING WRONG IN THE PIT OF

00:01:35.321 --> 00:01:36.004
THEIR STOMACH.

00:01:36.038 --> 00:01:38.724
YOU CAN SILENCE PEOPLE, YOU CAN

00:01:38.725 --> 00:01:41.563
DO PLATFORM PEOPLE AND GET AWAY

00:01:41.564 --> 00:01:42.748
WITH IT.

00:01:42.782 --> 00:01:44.809
EVERYBODY KNOWS -- REPUBLICAN OR

00:01:44.844 --> 00:01:46.371
DEMOCRAT -- SOMETHING IS WRONG.

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.662
BOTH SIDES OF THE ISLE UNITED ON

00:01:48.663 --> 00:01:50.128
THIS ONE THING, YOU NOTED THAT.

00:01:50.163 --> 00:01:51.540
BOTH SIDES UNITE IT BECAUSE IT

00:01:51.575 --> 00:01:53.446
WAS MONEY SORT OF TAKES THE

00:01:53.480 --> 00:01:54.743
POLITICS OUT OF IT.

00:01:54.778 --> 00:01:56.493
SO WHAT HAPPENS HERE IS THESE

00:01:56.494 --> 00:01:58.689
PEOPLE -- IF YOU ACTUALLY DIG

00:01:58.690 --> 00:02:00.022
INTO THE BOARDS, I THINK MY

00:02:00.023 --> 00:02:00.868
FIRST REACTION WAS OH, THERE’S A

00:02:00.903 --> 00:02:02.346
PUMP AND DUMP.

00:02:02.381 --> 00:02:04.700
BUT THAT’S REALLY NOT WHAT IS

00:02:04.735 --> 00:02:05.444
GOING ON.

00:02:05.479 --> 00:02:07.952
IF YOU ACTUALLY LOOK AT THE

00:02:07.986 --> 00:02:09.293
MESSAGES, THEY ARE MAD, THEY

00:02:09.327 --> 00:02:11.966
WANT TO PROVE SOMETHING, IT’S
NOT NECESSARILY ABOUT MONEY.

00:02:11.967 --> 00:02:14.068
NOT NECESSARILY ABOUT MONEY.

00:02:14.069 --> 00:02:19.323
BUT THEY ARE ANGRY AS.

00:02:19.325 --> 00:02:23.836
THEY HAVE SOME NOMINATION TO GET

00:02:23.837 --> 00:02:24.286
BACK.

00:02:24.287 --> 00:02:26.667
AND BADLY FOR THE STOCKS.

00:02:26.701 --> 00:02:28.226
I HOPE PEOPLE DON’T LOSE MONEY

00:02:28.228 --> 00:02:29.438
IN THE PROCESS.

00:02:29.472 --> 00:02:32.160
&gt;&gt; I WONDER, NOW THAT THIS HAS

00:02:32.162 --> 00:02:33.534
HAPPENED, EVERYBODY KNOWS IT HAS

00:02:33.536 --> 00:02:34.757
HAPPENED, AND THE HEDGE FUNDS

00:02:34.758 --> 00:02:36.900
AND WALL STREET STUFF IS MORE

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.338
VULNERABLE THAN ANYBODY IMAGINED

00:02:39.372 --> 00:02:41.321
AND THE INTERNET STILL EXIST.

00:02:41.323 --> 00:02:43.516
WHAT IS THIS GOING FORWARD?

00:02:43.517 --> 00:02:44.897
WE CAN’T CONTINUE AS WE HAVE,

00:02:44.932 --> 00:02:46.211
CAN WE?

00:02:46.245 --> 00:02:47.081
&gt;&gt; SURE.

00:02:47.082 --> 00:02:49.230
ONE THING WALL STREET AND THE

00:02:49.231 --> 00:02:51.133
HEDGE FUNDS ARE REALLY GOOD AT

00:02:51.167 --> 00:02:52.257
IS CLOSING GAPS AND FINDING

00:02:52.292 --> 00:02:53.291
THESE INEFFICIENCIES AND CLOSING

00:02:53.292 --> 00:02:54.055
THEM UP.

00:02:54.056 --> 00:02:55.578
SO WHAT THESE PEOPLE ON

00:02:55.579 --> 00:02:56.770
REDDIT -- HATS OFF TO THEM BY

00:02:56.804 --> 00:02:58.019
THE WAY.

00:02:58.053 --> 00:02:59.572
IT’S BRILLIANT WHAT THEY DID.

00:02:59.606 --> 00:03:01.187
THEY FOUND A REAL INEFFICIENCY

00:03:01.221 --> 00:03:03.415
IN THE MARKET AND A GAP WHERE

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:05.162
SOMETHING HAD BEEN DRAMATICALLY

00:03:05.163 --> 00:03:08.301
OVER SHORTED AND THEY COULD

00:03:08.303 --> 00:03:09.685
ACTUALLY GET ENOUGH BUYING

00:03:09.686 --> 00:03:09.973
POWER.

00:03:10.007 --> 00:03:11.980
WALL STREET NOW KNOWS THAT.

00:03:11.981 --> 00:03:14.317
SO I WOULD BE VERY SHOCKED IF

00:03:14.351 --> 00:03:15.370
HEDGE FUNDS WOULD CREATE ANOTHER

00:03:15.405 --> 00:03:17.380
SITUATION SO QUICKLY WHERE IT

00:03:17.381 --> 00:03:19.836
WAS SO OVERLY SHORTED THAT IT

00:03:19.838 --> 00:03:22.277
WOULD BE THAT EASY FOR PEOPLE TO

00:03:22.278 --> 00:03:24.603
COME IN AS A GROUP AND BRING THE

00:03:24.605 --> 00:03:25.680
STOCK BACK UP.

00:03:25.715 --> 00:03:27.591
SO THAT MIGHT -- BUT I BELIEVE

00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:28.688
THIS IS A PARADIGM SHIFT RIGHT

00:03:28.689 --> 00:03:29.533
NOW.

00:03:29.534 --> 00:03:31.716
THE LITTLE GUY FINALLY IS

00:03:31.750 --> 00:03:32.600
EQUIPPED, INFORMATION TRAVELS

00:03:32.634 --> 00:03:33.177
INSTANTLY.

00:03:33.178 --> 00:03:36.301
IT USED TO ONLY BE THE BIG GUYS.

00:03:36.336 --> 00:03:38.804
YOU SEE ALL THIS STUFF HAPPEN

00:03:38.838 --> 00:03:40.346
BEFORE THE LITTLE GUY, THE BIG

00:03:40.381 --> 00:03:41.812
GUYS POLLUTING AND DOING THE

00:03:41.813 --> 00:03:43.492
STUFF, SO NOW THE LITTLE GUY

00:03:43.493 --> 00:03:44.445
FINALLY HAS THE ABILITY TO

00:03:44.479 --> 00:03:46.009
DISPLAY THAT SAME GAME.

00:03:46.043 --> 00:03:46.772
AT LEAST SOMEWHAT.

00:03:46.806 --> 00:03:48.190
AND THERE IS GOING TO BE A

00:03:48.224 --> 00:03:50.506
RADICAL CHANGE, IT’S NOT GOING

00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:51.692
TO BE THE SAME.

00:03:51.694 --> 00:03:53.320
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I KNOW YOU’VE HAD A

00:03:53.321 --> 00:03:54.165
WILD PERSONAL LIFE.

00:03:54.166 --> 00:03:55.183
THAT WAS SO MUCH MORE

00:03:55.217 --> 00:03:56.187
INTERESTING AND INSIGHTFUL THAN

00:03:56.221 --> 00:03:57.400
ANYTHING I’VE HEARD ON ANY OTHER

00:03:57.434 --> 00:03:57.739
CHANNEL ON WHAT WE ARE SEEING

